# The theme folder doubles as the island source tree. Shopify CLI uploads
# everything it finds, so everything that is not one of the seven theme
# directories has to be named here — otherwise `shopify theme push` fails on
# files Shopify has no place for.
#
# Keep this in step with THEME_DIRS in ../build_theme_zip.py.
node_modules/
src/
_source/*
*.mjs
*.md
package.json
package-lock.json
vite.config.js
.shopifyignore
